<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fallen-tree-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fallen-tree-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fallen-tree-house.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/cities-we-serve/">Cities</a></li><li aria-current="page">Bremerton</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">Kitsap Peninsula</p><h1>Insurance Appraiser for Bremerton, WA</h1><p class="lede">Bremerton and the Kitsap Peninsula are surrounded by water and forest. Windstorms and falling trees are the leading causes of claims, and in 2018 a rare tornado struck nearby Port Orchard.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-y" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line light" href="/talk-to-an-appraiser/">Free claim review</a></div><dl class="hero-facts"><div><dt>County</dt><dd>Kitsap County</dd></div><div><dt>Region</dt><dd>Kitsap Peninsula</dd></div><div><dt>Inspections</dt><dd>On site</dd></div></dl></div></section><div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose"><div class="note local"><b class="h">Local claim risks in Bremerton</b><ul class="chips"><li>Windstorms</li><li>Falling trees</li><li>Rare tornadoes</li><li>Water leaks</li><li>Snow &amp; ice</li></ul><p class="housing"><b>Housing mix:</b> Older shipyard-era homes, waterfront properties, mid-century ranches and newer subdivisions.</p></div>

<h2>A peninsula exposed to wind</h2>
<p>Bremerton is the largest city in Kitsap County and home to Puget Sound Naval Shipyard. The Kitsap Peninsula is surrounded by water on most sides, leaving many homes exposed to storms coming off the Sound. Winter windstorms regularly bring down trees across the peninsula, damaging roofs and cutting power.</p>
<p>On December 18, 2018, an EF-2 tornado struck Port Orchard, just south of Bremerton, damaging dozens of homes. It was one of the strongest tornadoes in western Washington in decades and a reminder that wind damage here isn’t limited to winter storms.</p>
<h2>Kitsap housing</h2>
<p>Bremerton has older homes built during the shipyard’s growth, many now renovated. Waterfront homes line the shores of Sinclair Inlet and Dyes Inlet. Silverdale, Port Orchard and Poulsbo have mid-century and newer subdivisions, and much of the county is rural, with homes on wooded lots.</p>
<h2>Common Bremerton claims</h2>
<ul>
<li>Falling tree damage on wooded lots.</li>
<li>Wind damage to roofs and siding on waterfront homes.</li>
<li>Water damage from plumbing failures and frozen pipes.</li>
<li>Outbuilding and detached garage damage on rural properties.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Services available in Bremerton</h2>
<p>Every Washington Insurance Appraiser service is available to property owners in Bremerton and across Kitsap County, including:</p>
<ul><li><a href="/insurance-appraisal-services/appraisal-demand-representation/">Appraisal Clause Representation</a></li><li><a href="/insurance-appraisal-services/home-insurance-claim-appraisal/">Homeowner Claim Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/insurance-appraisal-services/condo-hoa-commercial-appraisal/">Condo, HOA &amp; Commercial Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/insurance-appraisal-services/roof-hail-damage-appraisal/">Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/insurance-appraisal-services/windstorm-tornado-appraisal/">Windstorm &amp; Tornado Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/insurance-appraisal-services/tree-impact-claim-appraisal/">Fallen Tree Damage Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/insurance-appraisal-services/water-rain-intrusion-appraisal/">Water &amp; Rain Intrusion Appraisal</a></li><li><a href="/insurance-appraisal-services/house-fire-smoke-appraisal/">Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</a></li></ul>
<h2>Questions from Bremerton property owners</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Do you serve the whole Kitsap Peninsula?<svg class="ico chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. We cover Port Orchard, Silverdale, Poulsbo, Bainbridge Island, Kingston and the rest of Kitsap County.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is a waterfront home harder to insure and value?<svg class="ico chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Waterfront homes can have higher exposure to wind and wave action. Wave and surge damage is usually a flood issue, while wind damage is typically covered under a homeowner policy.</p></div></details></div>
